{{- subject = "Payslip objection accepted: " + employee_name -}}
<p>Hello {{ recipient_name | html.escape }},</p>
<p>The objection of {{ employee_name | html.escape }} to the {{ period }} payslip was accepted. The payslip needs to be corrected.</p>
{{~ if action_url ~}}
{{ button "Open payroll" action_url }}
{{~ end ~}}
